<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0332_R05R0301_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You from Johto, ain’t you? How you like\nKanto?\fIt’s nice, right?\fHow many cities you been to?\fYou been to Cerulean yet?\fThe view at Cerulean Cape is crazy,\nright?\fIt’s a GOOD date spot.\fYou got somebody in mind?\fWho? Tell me! I won’t tell nobody!\r..................\rMy bad, am I bein’ too nosy? I’m a\nauntie. It’s my job.</language>
	</row>
</body>
